      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAST REPLY (5) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (35.09) last time in a R/A FIN at The Meadows. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MEPUNGA VELVET (7) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from four tries. Hit the frame latest (42.44) when third at Sandown in a Grade 4/5. Can hit the frame with the right run. ARCHER SWEET (2) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Finished second (31.49) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Well-placed to take this out. FLYING SARA (1) is new to this circuit but not to be underestimated.",
